WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:07.632
Sophie, what did you do
to the bathroom shelves? Look!

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:10.760
My hair's turned this weird color!

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:12.721
What... what beautiful hair.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:13.888
Take a good look!

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:17.475
You mixed up everything
on the shelves and ruined the spells.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.229
I didn't mix up anything,
I simply cleaned up.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.064
Cleaning, always cleaning.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:26.985
I told you not to get too carried away.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.486
It's hopeless.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.157
How humiliating.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.368
It's not that bad.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:46.171
This new shade's quite lovely.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:51.176
I'm done for. What's the point
in living, if you aren't beautiful...

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:05.565
Stop, Howl! Cut it out!

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:08.026
He's calling on the spirits of Darkness.

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:11.154
He did this last time a girl dumped him.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:16.534
Please, Howl, that's enough.

00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:20.497
You can just dye your hair again.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.510
I've had enough of you, Howl!

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.513
I've never once been beautiful!

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:40.141
I've had enough of this place!

